    - target: {fileID: 5861647120038106237, guid: fe2a95bb93932ff4d86d6f45f973c0d3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "    Good job! Here you can see all the ingredients you've added to
        the cup.\n    If you wish to redo the mix of ingredients, you can always
        press the <b>Reset</b> button to start over with an empty cup.\n    When
        you're done preparing the tea, you can press <b>Serve</b> to give it to your
        first customer."
